{"v":4,"catch":"Rail Trail 是一款遊戲，您需要在其中創建將黃金引導至目的地的鐵路系統。","desc":"這是一款完美的益智遊戲，您可以在其中測試您的所有技能，看看您能以多快的速度獲勝。 Rail Trail 非常令人興奮，身臨其境，它不斷為您帶來新的水平來測試您的技能。\n\n玩 Rail Trail 後，您將在嘗試解決遇到的所有挑戰時獲得很多樂趣。 每個級別都有一個全新的挑戰供您探索。 您有完成謎題和發現新謎題的能力嗎？\n\n特徵：\n100 多個關卡\n美麗的圖形\n測試您的解謎技巧","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2022-04-21","genres":["街機","益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86ba4aa6628df8259ee3bcd78508b7c2c631e875f90155ad3ce6c59b4e39af22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b4d148b59c3ffa67cee4f0a6e61b46dac6a787c51eabc694c280d2a92e0f288.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81c4a3476c6133f7b589e91e5d9b1930b9ab9ad52b6bba15f8aa89abcc76d7c6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dc0f0ed04eedd5310e09189b40700e179fb7edde122e54817e344af0b095ef65.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/87f457b7829dc620536c9dc34820800545842a6df23d0cfa5e6bbbd17d0ec1e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7a86bf9b97b4c4a9b5565b025954c74a165bea94595212f8c4842aff6eb811b3.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a310181dc000","dlc":[]}